Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Keep InkOS creation responsive behind the OpenStory proxy

Studio now derives assets, APIs, and SSE URLs from the /inkos base path, exposes direct script/storyboard/interactive-film entry modes, and keeps long agent responses alive with JSON-safe heartbeat chunks so Cloudflare does not replace successful background work with a 524.\n\nConstraint: Cloudflare closes idle proxied responses before some agent runs finish, while Nginx already permits 300 seconds.\nRejected: Increase the Nginx timeout | it cannot override Cloudflare origin response limits.\nConfidence: high\nScope-risk: moderate\nDirective: Build Studio with INKOS_BASE_PATH=/inkos and keep the agent heartbeat interval below the proxy idle timeout.\nTested: Studio typecheck; 55 mode/UI tests; 5 message action tests; 16 API/SSE/heartbeat tests; client/server builds; public first-byte trace; real script and interactive-film generations.\nNot-tested: Full upstream core suite under Bun because its existing Zod/pi-agent test fixtures fail before these Studio changes.
